aps bring up Candidate A (since A hasn't been discussed yet). Also we need to maintain coverage of all candidates before final recommendation. So we should discuss Candidate A now, compare with C, and state our vote (likely still C). Provide evidence: A can anticipate dangerous situations, sees complex connections, excellent spatial vision, very good leadership qualities, but is unfriendly, eats unhealthily, regarded as show-off, not open to new ideas. We can argue that A's unfriendly attitude and lack of openness are serious concerns for crew cooperation and adaptability, outweighing his technical strengths. So C remains best.\n\nThus Sofia's public message: agree with previous points, bring up A, compare, maintain vote for C.\n\nWe need to output PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
